WEBVTT

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:37.280
The 2nd and 3rd section of Higashizou will be closed today at 6 p.m.

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:40.730
The rest of the work will be completed by 4 p.m.

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:44.800
I'm scared of the Ayanami of Soto-san.

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:50.600
Come on, Asuka.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:55.510
Yeah.

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:56.820
Come on.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:58.220
Yeah.

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:01.730
Please let me go...

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:29.190
It's a kind of warning.

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:32.900
That boy was the last one to die, wasn't he?

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:36.430
Yeah, all the other ones must have disappeared.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:38.730
Doesn't that mean we're at peace now?

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:42.140
What's going to happen to Eva?

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:46.590
I think NERV will be dismantled.

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:49.180
We don't know what's going to happen to us.

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.910
We'll have to wait until the restoration plan is completed.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:59.560
What a mess.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:06.920
It's an ideal world for the human race to evolve into a complete unit of a living human being as an army.

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:12.660
That's why I'm still going to use the committee.

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:15.800
Not Adam and Nelph, but that Eva.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:18.080
As Kaji-kun predicted.

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:21.130
The promise has come.

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:26.000
Now that we've lost Longinus' spear, we can't preserve it by Lilith.

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:29.200
The only way to do that is to take Lilith's avatar, Eva.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:30.480
I hope for the best.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:32.990
It's different from Xe'rae's scenario.

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:38.240
People existed to create EVA.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:40.650
People should move on to a new world.

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:44.320
It's the EVA series for that purpose.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:48.560
We won't get on a ship called EVA until we abandon our human form.

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:51.430
This is a passing ritual.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.220
It's for humanity to be reborn.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:58.030
The fate of destruction is the joy of the new life.

00:05:58.470 --> 00:05:59.760
Kami Mojito

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:03.460
All living things will die and eventually become one.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.280
Death will not give birth to anything.

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.540
Death will be given to you.

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:14.840
There is an existence where you try to live.

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:17.880
That is her wish that remained in Eva herself.

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:25.070
This is the truth of Second Impact.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:34.420
No, that's not it.

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:37.060
It's starting.

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:41.180
Daigoku Net on scene 2.

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:44.630
Switch to the blue emergency communication on the left.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:45.530
You can open the satellite.

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:48.470
That's right. What's the situation on the right?

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:51.560
All the external networks and information connections have been shut down.

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:54.440
The enemy is Magi?

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:56.640
Data entry from all external terminals.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.330
We are aiming for packing to Magi.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:00.700
That's bad.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:03.720
Are the intruders Magi No. 2 from Matsushiro?

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.930
No, at least Magi Type 5.

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:07.650
We can confirm that they're intruders from Germany, China, and America.

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:10.650
They're using their full power.

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.810
The difference in force between them is 1 to 5.

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:14.790
They're bad.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:17.430
The fourth attack has been repelled.

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:19.580
The main database is closed.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:21.810
It's no good! We can't cut the progress!

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:23.860
Furthermore, the reform department has intruded.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:24.800
We can't stop the call-out.

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:27.260
This is bad.

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.770
Magi's election is the same as the headquarter's...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:30.360
Because it's the same thing.

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:41.910
I know.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:44.960
It's a self-defense against evil, isn't it?

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:45.960
Yes.

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:48.600
For more details, please go to the second release book, Ibuki 2.

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:53.020
Even a strong and abandoned woman will use it.

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:54.540
Egoist.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:55.320
Human.

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:58.140
The current state of affairs.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:04.840
Good morning. A801 has just been released from Tokyo.

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:05.980
A801?

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:07.300
It's a special order from NERV.

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:08.980
It's a special order from NERV.

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:10.380
It's a special order from NERV.

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:11.220
It's a special order from NERV.

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:15.680
Yes, that's right.

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:18.060
The MAGI is currently under hacking.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:19.860
It's being pushed quite a bit.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.430
It's Ibuki.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.470
Dr. Akagi is now working on the protection.

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:41.320
Do you think I'm stupid?

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:45.390
It's not logic, man and woman.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:49.330
That's right.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:56.600
The return rate of the ground is increasing by 0.2%.

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:58.040
How much time is left?

00:09:58.140 --> 00:09:59.550
It seems to be in time.

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:02.770
Dr. Masugawa Akagi, 120 pages.

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:03.930
Only the invasion of the Magi?

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:05.910
They're not that kind of people.

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:07.960
Maybe...

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.500
The Magi won't go beyond the front line.

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:14.380
Their goal is to direct the election to the headquarters and the remaining EVA units.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:17.810
Yes, Lilith.

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:19.860
And Adam is with us.

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.850
The elders are in a hurry.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:28.470
The King has stopped.

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:33.740
After 62 hours, it is impossible to go outside.

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:43.490
Mom, see you later.

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:48.420
Ikari has used the 666 Protect against Magi.

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:50.090
This breakthrough is not easy.

00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:52.010
We have to stop Magi's attack.

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:58.410
I wanted to proceed as smoothly as possible, but there is no way.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.160
We will conduct a direct invasion of the facility.

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:13.650
Yes, as planned.

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:56.460
The last enemy was the same person.

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:59.720
The first battle location.

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:05.640
They're not the same person, but they're the same person.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:08.010
They don't think that way.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:33.350
Hey, what's going on?

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:33.900
Hey!

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:34.930
What is it?

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:36.730
It's a hub station in the south.

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:37.110
What?

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:50.510
The tunnel cannot be used.

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:52.300
The fire has spread to the 5th half of the west.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.800
The infiltration unit has been transferred to the 1st floor.

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:58.080
The west side unit is on the same side.

00:12:58.280 --> 00:12:59.940
The real name is Eva's election...

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:01.120
I'm targeting the pilot.

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:03.240
Send Shinji to Unit 1 immediately.

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:04.220
Yes.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:05.100
Where's Asuka?

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:06.080
She's in Room 303.

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:09.110
I don't care, so take her to Unit 2.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.860
But the synchronization with Eva hasn't been restored yet.

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:15.290
If that's the case, it'll be erased for sure.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:16.910
It's best to hide in Eva.

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:18.890
Roger that.

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:20.440
Stopping the pilot's intervention.

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:22.580
After Asuka dies, hide Eva in Unit 2.

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:25.480
We'll find her soon, but it's better than a detective.

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:27.020
Where's Rei?

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:28.120
We don't know where she is.

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:29.380
We can't confirm her location.

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:31.660
They're going to kill us.

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:32.720
Hurry up!

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:52.360
The second plane is taking off.

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:54.520
It will be fixed at 70 from Route 8.

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:57.110
Next, the first plane is taking off.

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:58.280
Place it inside the geofloat.

00:13:59.200 --> 00:13:59.800
It's no good!

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.220
The pilot is still there!

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:20.550
The third nuclear reactor has been destroyed and the second layer has been invaded!

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:26.330
It's a matter of time before we can do anything about it.

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:29.330
Professor Fuyutsuki...

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:31.780
I know.

00:14:32.340 --> 00:14:33.430
I'm counting on you, Yui-kun.

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:02.200
We can't contact you.

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.880
Linear rail 52 has been blocked.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:06.500
This is not good.

00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:08.460
This is not good at all.

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:09.660
It's not impossible.

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:11.700
We're all not used to killing people.

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:25.570
Let's get out of here.

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:33.560
A intruder into the 3rd floor B block!

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:35.240
We can't defend it!

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:38.920
The main bypass was attacked from the F block.

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:40.700
We'll evacuate to the 3rd floor.

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:42.700
The head unit, get down.

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:46.570
Put the bakelite into all the corridors and pipes up to section 803.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:47.990
Yes, ma'am!

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:49.290
Put the bakelite into section 703.

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:57.310
It'll take a while.

00:15:57.570 --> 00:15:59.070
Mr. Katsuragi!

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.380
Route 47 has been cut off, and the group is being stopped.

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:04.620
Shinji is in the way!

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:14.060
Avoid the white soldier battle as much as you can.

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:16.480
He's a professional.

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:19.570
If it's impossible to return to Dogma, you'd better surrender.

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:23.210
Sorry, take care of the rest.

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:23.590
Yes.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.290
It's surprisingly time-consuming.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.770
It's not an easy job for us.

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:33.750
That's not good.

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:36.220
We don't have a proper anti-personnel system.

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:41.160
Well, we're stuck here.

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:44.870
If Senji was serious, this facility wouldn't be a problem.

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:46.930
If I think about it,

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:48.380
reducing the budget for intruders and anti-personnel

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:50.530
is something we can't afford.

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:52.540
That's possible.

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:05.190
Take off the lock.

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:09.860
I can't shoot.

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:12.780
You've trained many times.

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:19.160
I'll die if I don't shoot!

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:55.320
Well, as promised. Let's go.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:00.900
We're under pressure. Send it in.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.720
The second launch site, Maggi Original, is not yet secured.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:05.570
It's in combat on the Kato Floor.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:09.680
The Marvorgia will enter the heat-shrink zone.

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:17.150
The Eva pilot will fire as soon as he finds it.

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:19.440
Unconditional fire at the non-combatants is also allowed.

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:22.500
Yanagihara Dai, Shinjo Tai, enter Kato immediately.

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:29.250
Third found.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:30.800
Let's get rid of him.

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:34.640
I don't think it's a good idea.

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:45.820
Don't think it's a bad idea.

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:53.320
Now, let's go to Unit 01.

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:02.140
There's no problem with the intake of the brake lights.

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:04.240
The next station is the first station.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:05.420
Please stop the train.

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:06.940
This is bad.

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:09.410
They're trying to establish physical contact between Unit 01 and Shinji.

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:13.560
We can't do anything about it.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:14.980
Hurry up!

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:21.580
Shinji, you can either run away from here or go to Eva.

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:25.770
If you stay here, you'll just die!

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:33.620
I'm the one who's always been the one to get on girls' backs, run away, and cheat on them.

00:19:33.680 --> 00:19:35.540
I'm the one who's always been the one to get on girls' backs, run away, and cheat on them.

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:47.380
You're saying that because you're so annoying!

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:50.740
But you're still alive, aren't you?

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:52.770
Then you should live and die!

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:58.060
You're not going anywhere.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.260
Let's prioritize the division of Saradogma.

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:09.500
It's being blown up here and there, but I still can't get my hands on it.

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:14.220
I'd like to put it together at once, but there's Magi's original down there.

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:16.900
I want to get as much as I can without getting hurt.

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:19.580
But there's not enough anti-BC weaponry.

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:21.630
It would be dangerous if it was used.

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:23.130
N2 weapons, too.

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:47.750
I don't think so.

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:50.170
They don't know what they're talking about?

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:51.720
I'm not afraid.

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:06.280
I intend to make a third impact, using the Ever Series, not the Apostles.

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:13.330
The second impact 15 years ago was made by humans, but that was...

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:17.070
Before the other Apostles were awakened, by bringing Adam back to the egg,

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:20.950
it was to minimize the damage.

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:27.050
Shinjuku, we humans are the same as Adam,

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:29.630
Lilith, the same as Adam, is a living organism called Lilith.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:32.930
It's the 18th disciple born from the source.

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:35.620
The other disciples had a different possibility.

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.180
Human beings who abandoned the shape of people.

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:42.160
It's just a sad existence where we had no choice but to refuse each other.

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:45.320
The same human beings.

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:47.910
Listen, Shinji.

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:49.380
We're going to get rid of all the Eva series.

00:21:51.020 --> 00:21:52.080
That's the only way to survive.

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:56.440
I can't get through the phone.

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:01.370
I've confirmed the explosion.

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:05.590
The plan to preserve humanity that NERV has been promoting behind the scenes.

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:10.160
The purpose was to provoke the Third Impact, which will erase everything.

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:17.040
A creature that can hate itself is as much as a human being.

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:20.950
Tch. The rest is waiting for the NERV headquarters.

00:22:22.930 --> 00:22:24.750
Will Germany or China be entrusted with redevelopment?

00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:29.230
It's a waste to be beaten. 20 years is a waste.

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:37.650
The heat has gone. There is no problem with the high pressure.

00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:41.250
The initial position of the unit has been completed.

00:22:42.170 --> 00:22:45.130
Currently, the Dogma III and the purple one are under control.

00:22:45.710 --> 00:22:46.980
The red one?

00:22:47.280 --> 00:22:49.530
We have found the 702 water core.

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:52.080
The pilot's identity is unknown.

00:26:30.600 --> 00:26:31.100
I'll give you 10,000 yen for the Kotsutora.

00:27:12.510 --> 00:27:17.050
Ava, who should have been alive, will be our scapegoat again.

00:27:17.150 --> 00:27:20.400
After all, poison should be created with the same poison.

00:28:02.720 --> 00:28:06.070
It's too exaggerated to put 9 units in all the S2 machines.

00:28:07.980 --> 00:28:10.800
Are you going to do it here?

00:28:31.120 --> 00:28:34.240
Good, good, Asuka. The EVA series will definitely be wiped out.

00:28:34.540 --> 00:28:37.700
I'll give you Shinji-kun right away. Do your best.

00:28:38.860 --> 00:28:41.860
So, the first line can go at Route 20 for emergency, right?

00:28:42.340 --> 00:28:44.270
Yes, the power is secured at 30.

00:28:44.990 --> 00:28:47.540
If you ride for less than 3 minutes, you can go straight to the 7th gauge.

00:29:03.710 --> 00:29:05.530
I'm going to annihilate you, no matter what.

00:29:05.530 --> 00:29:09.300
Misato, you went easy on me at the end of the night.

00:29:09.620 --> 00:29:13.100
In three and a half minutes, there are nine of them.

00:29:13.100 --> 00:29:15.440
There's only 20 seconds left.

00:29:36.910 --> 00:29:37.550
It's here.

00:29:46.140 --> 00:29:55.600
He escaped.

00:29:55.920 --> 00:29:57.330
No reinforcements can be shot.

00:29:57.890 --> 00:29:58.670
Ask for follow-up.

00:30:04.820 --> 00:30:26.560
The power supply is alive.

00:30:26.820 --> 00:30:27.820
We can do this.

00:30:34.830 --> 00:30:38.800
Listen, Shinji. From now on, you're the only one left.

00:30:38.800 --> 00:30:41.260
You have to decide everything on your own, without anyone's help.

00:30:44.010 --> 00:30:47.370
I can't do this. I can't do this.

00:30:47.650 --> 00:30:53.970
I don't have the right to go to EVA until I kill you.

00:30:54.190 --> 00:30:57.860
I thought I had no choice but to go to EVA.

00:31:00.000 --> 00:31:01.720
But I lied to you.

00:31:01.980 --> 00:31:04.880
I don't know anything. I don't deserve to ride an EVAN.

00:31:05.404 --> 00:31:08.604
There's nothing I can do for others!

00:31:10.876 --> 00:31:12.876
I did a terrible thing.

00:31:13.404 --> 00:31:15.404
I killed Kaoru-kun too.

00:31:15.676 --> 00:31:17.316
There's no such thing as kindness.

00:31:17.316 --> 00:31:18.856
It's just that she's mean and cowardly.

00:31:19.100 --> 00:31:21.600
All I can do is hurt people.

